     "explanation": "Groundhog It, named after the film Groundhog Day, means repeating the same Highlight over consecutive days. This removes decision fatigue because the choice is already made, and it lets the work compound and ride a learning curve. Rotating a new Highlight daily is the opposite move, and while morning work and exploding a Highlight are real tactics, they are not what Groundhog It describes.",
