     "explanation": "The authors argue that Infinity Pools are professionally designed to defeat willpower, so relying on in-the-moment resolve is a losing bet. Friction tactics like deleting apps, logging out, and clearing the homescreen change the environment so the tempting choice is harder before you ever face it. Make Time is explicitly not anti-technology, and willpower is treated as a limited resource, which is exactly why the authors prefer design.",
