" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Eats without screens.</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"625\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Notices fullness again.</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"430\" width=\"450\" height=\"230\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"805\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Caffeine</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"540\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">First cup 45 min after waking.</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"575\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Timed before the Highlight.</text><text x=\"805\" y=\"625\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hard last call at 2 p.m.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"690\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"745\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Levers Compound</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"805\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cutting the 4 p.m. coffee improved sleep,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" font-size=\"21\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">which improved every lever the next day.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The fog lifted by the weekend.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1000\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1045\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Better sleep fuels everything downstream.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Four levers changed one at a time compound fast."
