     "explanation": "Caffeine's half-life means roughly half of an afternoon dose is still in your bloodstream near bedtime, quietly degrading sleep quality. Because sleep is the foundation of the entire Energize step, poor sleep drains the next day's focus. Caffeine does not stop working after lunch, and the reasoning is about sleep protection, not empty stomachs or same-day tolerance.",
